cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: 'rapR: R Interface for Using Genius and Spotify API'
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Gonzales
    given-names: Josh
    email: jgonza10@uoguelph.ca
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8633-3380'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/phdemotions/rapR'
url: 'https://joshgonzales.ca'
abstract: >-
  rapR provides an interface to the Genius and Spotify APIs,
  allowing users to retrieve annotations, referents, song details,
  artist details, and search results directly from R. This package
  simplifies the process of accessing music metadata and lyrics
  annotations for research and analysis purposes.
keywords:
  - R
  - Genius API
  - Spotify API
  - music data
  - lyrics
  - API wrapper
license: MIT
date-released: '2024-01-11'
